  "modeling_notes": [
    "The current official undergraduate catalog is 2025-2026. No 2026-2027 edition is inferred or modeled.",
    "The categorical major is exactly 43 fixed computer science and mathematics credits plus at least six mathematics elective credits and six upper-level CSC/DATA elective credits, for a 55-credit minimum.",
    "Extraction stops before the separately labeled Course Map. Its prospective terms, suggested course placements, and conflicting CSC 407 schedule-row value are not degree requirements and are absent from the requirement tree.",
